1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,062
Could you fly backwards?

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,800
Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,000
Dragonflies can fly backwards!

4
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:09,300
And stay still in the air!

5
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:12,457
Front wings up, back wings down!

6
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:16,647
Six legs? In you go!

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,399
I can go backwards too!

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,850
Watch the corners!

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,700
Which way is Zip flying?
